New Gauntlet Weapon Appearance
Strike like a hawk snatching a hare, swift as thunder;
Pursue like a hound chasing deer, never leaving your quarry's shadow.

Besides conventional status and merit ranking, Masked Troupe also aggregates merits earned by all disciples on the leaderboard into the #Ytotal troupe popularity#E:
Total troupe popularity of #Y0~9999#E:  #YCatching Melody;#E;
Total troupe popularity of #Y>10,000#E:  #YElegant Ensemble#E;
Total troupe popularity of #Y>50,000#E:  #YMelody Harmony#E;
Total troupe popularity of #Y>200,000#E:  #YHeavenly Song#E.

To find these items, you must be observant:

If you encounter #a66829Spectral Soldiers#E, avoid them;
If you spot a #a66829lantern#E, that marks a path to safety;
If you meet a #a66829masked lantern bearer#E, you may seek assistance from them.

Participating in various multiplayer activities around the Inkbound Order's Cuju Field can count toward corresponding leaderboards based on the Wanderer's sect.
Drunkenness gained by drinking or sharing drinks at the #YBreezy Feast#E counts toward the #YDrinking Leaderboard#E;
Reading progress gained by reading at the #YReading Nook#E counts toward the #YReading Leaderboard#E;
Participating in #YRiddle#E and #YPitch Pot#E at the Cuju Field can also count toward the corresponding leaderboards based on wins.
In addition, duel points earned by participating in any #YWar of Words#E match count toward the #YGift of Gab Leaderboard#E.
All leaderboards refresh at #Y5:00 AM#E daily.

Dear Wanderer,
On this auspicious day, as your birthday arrives, we offer our sincere congratulations.

First wish: may the road ahead be clear and all go smoothly;
Second wish: may you smile by morning and sleep soundly by night;
Third wish: may you enjoy good health year after year and all your wishes come true;

Thinking back on this jianghu, we have seen pear blossoms fall like snow and bustling markets in full clamor; we have seen the bright moon hanging high and mighty mountains rising before us.
Vast are the mountains and rivers. How fortunate to meet you on the hero's road, sword in hand between heaven and earth.
The road ahead is long. We look forward to carrying osmanthus wine with you and journeying once more through rivers, mountains, wind, and moon.

Please accept this modest gift as a token of our feelings. May peace attend you always.

