#YProcesses#E raw resources from the #YRaw Material Station#E into #Ysemi-finished products#E;
2 Output Ports: Place up to 2 Terminal Pivot Towers within the effective range to transport materials to downstream facilities;
2 Input Ports: Place up to 2 Terminal Pivot Towers within the effective range to receive materials from upstream facilities;
After selecting a #YRecipe#E, raw materials can be added #Ymanually#E (deducted from the Homestead Warehouse) or delivered automatically via #Ytransport lines#E from upstream facilities.
